ng\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Slingshot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slingshot_b01c4e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Wolf_Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wolf_Trophy_8a9152.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Lion_Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_Trophy_336d38.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Deer_Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"33\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deer_Trophy_950995.gif\" width=\"33\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\"><img alt=\"Small_Ruby\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Ruby_5305df.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Poacher Caves/Poachers</b> are located north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>, south in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ferngrims%20Gate\">Ferngrims Gate</a> accessed <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32754,31928,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32754, 31928, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>Sometimes you will not find this cave here, but <a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher%20Caves%2FGame\">Poacher Caves/Game</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher%20Caves%2FGloomy\">Poacher Caves/Gloomy</a> instead. This is because they are all part of a <a href=\"#/quest/poacher-caves-mini-world-change\">Poacher Caves Mini World Change</a>.\n</p><p>If you skip the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a> cave, this is one of a few places that can sustain <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> for almost unlimited hassle-free hunt time. This is due to the abundance of dropped arrows and food.\nBecause neither <a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poachers</a> nor <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a> can <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">sense invisible</a>, with a continuous use of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a>, you will not receive any damage. This fact makes the hunt hassle-free in contrast to nearby <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Orc Fortress</a>, where you have to be wary of <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leaders</a>. Moreover, since <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a> have very high exp/hp ratio and low armor, it is an ideal place for low-level characters to quickly gain lots of experience.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Floor_1\">Floor 1</span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\"><img alt=\"Poacher\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poacher_452ba2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poacher</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">90</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">70 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>Leather Helmet (common)</li>\n<li>1-18× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Legs\">Leather Legs</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Closed%20Trap\">Closed Trap</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\"><img alt=\"Hunter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunter_bbba27.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-22× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Hunter's Quiver (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Orange</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Necklace\">Dragon Necklace</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer%20Trophy\">Deer Trophy</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sniper%20Gloves\">Sniper Gloves</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a